@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 05. LangGraph4J Orchestration

skinparam shadowing false

start

:Request Validate Node;
:History Load Node;
:Checkpoint State Load Node;
:Plan Node;

if (Capability?) then (knowledge-retrieval)
  :Research Execute Node;
elseif (live-data-query)
  :Market Execute Node;
else (action-execution)
  :Action Execute Node;
endif

if (Need Handoff?) then (yes)
  :Handoff Node;
  :Plan Node;
endif

:Compose Node;
:History Persist Node;
:Checkpoint State Persist Node;
:Streaming Emit Node;

note right
LangGraph4J mapping
- StateGraph<PlanningContext>
- conditional edges
- checkpoint persistence
- LangGraph4J is required
- default backing store is Redis
- checkpoint store is required as part of the graph runtime
end note

stop
@enduml
